n- Tests run locally with Python 3.14.4, SQLite, and uv, without Docker.\n- Real FAB role-based authorization integration is not tested. The `generate-openapi-spec` and `mypy-airflow-core` prek hooks cannot complete locally because Docker and the C compiler/Kerberos headers are unavailable. GitHub CI is pending.\n\nFixes #73284\n\n---\n\n##### Was generative AI tooling used to co-author this PR?\n\n- [X] Yes (OpenAI Codex, GPT-6)\n\nGenerated-by: Codex (GPT-6) following [the guidelines](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/05_pull_requests.rst#gen-ai-assisted-contributions)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/74576/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/74576/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]]
